### BASE URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

---

### 1. REGISTER USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "leo@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "username": "Leo"
}

# ---

# ### 2. LOGIN USER
