### 4. GET USER PROFILE (PROTECTED API)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJRTVNHMk9GS1Q1OFRHRU1BIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgwMjEwMDU1LCJleHAiOjE3ODAyMjA4NTV9.eEIlJzfSm2Hn8o2UV0V8a-Z2YU-SdFcv_pGMViJ2TvE
